name: login, character select, enter the world (START_ACK), 30 s alive, no CRASH; a stray (untagged) click is dropped
timeout: 360
include _login
alive 8
shot world
# the tag's self-test: an untagged click on the navigation map button, as a person's would be, must be dropped
# (programs/clientpoc/poc_input.cpp logs it) and must not open the map
stray click gadget hud.navmap
expect-event stubs '^POC input: NOT REPLAYED \(dropped\) 0x201'
expect-no stubs 'UIStarmapPipViewClass'
alive 22
